    <string name="tutorial_title">HOW TO PLAY</string>
    <string name="tutorial_step">STEP %1$d OF %2$d</string>
    <string name="tutorial_1_title">PRESS A CLUSTER</string>
    <string name="tutorial_1_body">Press any bloom that touches 2 or more of its own colour. The whole cluster bursts and costs one move.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_2_title">BIGGER IS BETTER</string>
    <string name="tutorial_2_body">A cluster of 4 or more charges the bloom meter. The score grows with the square of the cluster size.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_3_title">CRACK THE CRUST</string>
    <string name="tutorial_3_body">Sugar crust cannot be pressed. Burst a cluster beside it and the crust cracks, then melts away.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_4_title">SWEEP THE BED</string>
    <string name="tutorial_4_body">The big pink button sweeps the bottom row. With a full meter it clears every bloom of the colour your goal still needs.</string>

